sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Campo as Team lead
  participant WA as WhatsApp
  participant API as Truway API
  participant BT as budget-treasury
  actor Apr as Approver
  participant IDX as Indexer
  Campo->>WA: Photo of the receipt
  WA->>API: Webhook with the image
  API->>API: Stores the file and computes SHA-256
  API->>API: AI reads amount, supplier, date and tax ID
  API-->>Campo: Which budget line is it?
  Campo->>WA: Budget line number
  API->>BT: propose(RecordExpense) signed by the team lead
  Note over API,BT: On testnet a demo signer signs
  BT-->>API: proposal_created
  Apr->>API: Approve
  API->>BT: approve(id) signed by the approver
  Note over BT: Checks role, line, room left<br/>and that the document is unused
  BT-->>API: expense_recorded and proposal_executed
  IDX->>BT: getEvents every 15 s
  IDX->>API: Stores the events
